  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 Training Module - Working with Older Persons in Forced Displacement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising UNCHR&apos;s staff awareness on the protection concerns and capacities of olderpersons protected and assisted by UNHCR;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening UNCHR&apos;s staff skills to apply human rights principles reflected in relevant policies and guidance on older persons to a range of programs and sectors</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting UNHCR&apos;s staff in the design of immediate and long-term strategies to mitigate protection risks and promote the inclusion of older persons in UNHCR programming</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to improve UNHCR staff&apos;s skills on the protection of older persons living in forced displacement and situations of statelessness through the development of a Training Module as a supporting tool to the updated Need to Know Guidance on working with older people in forced displacement, updated in 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
